{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And also the priests.</b> These are the seventy elders who were firstborn." "<b>Let them sanctify themselves.</b> Let them be prepared and careful regarding this, and not say: we are the ministers of the Place and the members of His household. Another interpretation: the priests are the officers and the judges." "<b>Who approach YHWH.</b> To teach laws, as it is written: ״for the judgment is Elohim's״; they too must be careful regarding this, so they do not say: we need to learn halakhot and laws. And one cannot say [these are] actual priests, for they had not yet been invested as priests."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:58:53.703760087Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}